SUMMARY:NORDMOE & THE RODEO
DESCRIPTION:\nAlissa Nordmoe\, her steel guitar\, and The Rodeo are on a mi
 ssion to deliver an assortment of the saddest and silliest country tunes a
  pair of boots can scoot\, two-step\, or waltz to!\n\n\n\nY'all will have 
 a blast with Nordmoe &amp\; the Rodeo!\n\n\n\nMusic from 8:30-11:30\, $10 
 cover at the door!\n\n\n\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jackofthewood.com/wp-content/uploads/202
 6/08/09-05-26_NordmoeAndTheRadio_IG_1080x1440.jpg
