SUMMARY:Meschiya Lake and the Mood Swingers
DESCRIPTION:\nPrepare for an unforgettable evening as Meschiya Lake and the
  Mood Swingers make their debut at Jack of the Wood on August 24th\, 2024!
  From 9pm to midnight\, experience the soulful sounds of this celebrated a
 rtist and her Asheville band. With a $10 cover charge at the door\, don’
 t miss your chance to see Meschiya Lake live.\n\n\n\nNewly based in Ashevi
 lle\, Meschiya Lake's journey began at age nine in South Dakota and took h
 er from circus stages to the vibrant streets of New Orleans. Her powerful 
 voice and dynamic performances have garnered accolades\, including Female 
 Performer of the Year at the Big Easy Awards and recognition from NPR.\n\n
 \n\nHaving toured globally\, from Lincoln Center to stages across Europe a
 nd beyond\, Meschiya Lake brings her unique blend of jazz and soul to Ashe
 ville. Join us at Jack of the Wood on August 24th for an evening of timele
 ss melodies and captivating performances. Mark your calendars for a night 
 of music that will leave you inspired after an evening of dancing to New O
 rleans sounds!\n\n\n\n\nhttps://youtu.be/okunHhYf1L4\n\n\n\n\n\nhttps://ww
 w.youtube.com/watch?v=1eexNOIO9CI\n\n\n\n\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jackofthewood.com/wp-content/uploads/202
 6/08/09-18-26_MeschiyaLakeMoodSwingers_IG_1080x1440.jpg
END:VEVENT
