SUMMARY:The Old Chevrolette Set
DESCRIPTION:\nThe Old Chevrolette Set performs old-school country duets wit
 h tunes you can two-step to! With vocal harmonies swimming in pedal steel 
 — and classic music from World War II to Watergate —&nbsp\;this ain't 
 no jet-set band!\n\n\n\nDavid Zoll and Laura Blackley provide vocals &amp\
 ; play guitars à la George &amp\; Tammy\, Gram &amp\; Emmylou\, and Loret
 ta &amp\; Conway. Tom Pittman (host of WNCW’s Country Gold) plays pedal 
 steel. The band is rounded out by a solid rhythm section comprised of Cary
  Fridley on bass and Dave Perkins on drums. \n\n\n\nWhen you take a ride w
 ith the Chevrolette\, it's always a good time! And George &amp\; Tammy wou
 ld love it!Music 8:30-11:30pm $10 cover at the door.\n\n\n\n\nhttps://yout
 u.be/Fjjz9qOacCo\n\n\n\n\n\nhttps://youtu.be/PbLsnvXdowQ\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n
 \n\n\n\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jackofthewood.com/wp-content/uploads/202
 6/08/09-19-26_OldChevroletteSet_IG_1080x1440-2.jpg
