URL:https://jackofthewood.com/events/carson-bull-and-the-cousins/
SUMMARY:Carson Bull and the Cousins
DESCRIPTION:\nCarson Bull is a Nashville-based singer-songwriter making wav
 es in Americana and country music\, blending deep Midwestern roots with a 
 voice that cuts through the noise. Originally from Huntertown\, Indiana\, 
 he draws on the storytelling of Bob Dylan and Waylon Jennings\, the grit o
 f Chris Stapleton\, and the melodic sensibility of The Eagles to create a 
 sound that lives at the crossroads of heartland rock and modern folk-count
 ry—timeless\, honest\, and distinctly his own.\n\n\n\nHis debut single 
 “Tomorrow” (May 2025) introduced listeners to a powerful mix of gravel
  and grace\, followed by “Better Off in Blue” (July 2025)\, which show
 cased his growing sonic range and lyrical depth. His album “Redshift” 
 shook the Nashville scene with a sold out release show at The 5 Spot in Ma
 rch 2026. Backed by his live band “The Cousins”\, Carson delivers raw\
 , dynamic performances that leave a lasting impression—proving he’s bu
 ilding a sound of his own.Music from 8:30-11:30pm $10 cover at the door.\n
 \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/shorts/eKTtLUmG4x4\n\n\n\n\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jackofthewood.com/wp-content/uploads/202
 6/08/2I9A2305.jpg
END:VEVENT
